{
  "description": "shuttle_glider/tracking, variant base (w_power 0.05), seed 3, agent_120000.pt. The mission flights use the limits of the training references: peak acceleration 3 m/s^2 (--traj_a_max, which also sets the minimum turn radius V^2/a_max), peak deceleration of the task table decel_max at the cruise speed (0.7 m/s^2 at 12 m/s, 0.45 m/s^2 at 14 m/s), smoothstep ramps >= 2.5 s, curvature ramps 2 s. Run a 'play_multi' command from the repository root (add --headless to run without the viewport). Dashboard (isaac_run examples/rl/dashboard_final.py, http://127.0.0.1:8055): paste this whole file into 'Controllers manifest' and set the fields of a flight's 'dashboard' block; extra keys are ignored.",
  "vehicle": "shuttle_glider2",
  "vehicles": [
    {
      "name": "base_s03",
      "type": "ppo2",
      "task": "shuttle_glider/tracking",
      "preset": "default",
      "checkpoint": "examples/rl/tasks/shuttle_glider/tracking/logs/variants/base/train/s03/*_PPO2/checkpoints/agent_120000.pt",
      "run_metadata": "examples/rl/tasks/shuttle_glider/tracking/logs/variants/base/train/s03/*_PPO2/run_metadata.json",
      "note": "w_power 0.05, ||da|| on unclipped actions"
    }
  ],
  "flights": {
